                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Video for your enjoyment:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gpi2FVe0pRg\n\nSo, this is a review on the game as it is [i]currently.[/i]\n\nThe game costs over $3 and has only three 1-minute long levels. You can do everything to do in the game in that amount of time as well. It's extremely short and the scoring is pointless. I'd rather play with no time limit if anything since you can stand against a rock continuously giving it a mustache to get the highest score. \nThe physics of the game are fun, but it really ends there.\n\nI'd love to see a sandbox mode with the models available to create giant mustache monster, or I'd like to see a level that took more than 10 second to explore fully. \n\nMy review may change when it's no longer early access, but until then, it gets a no from me.",
